      <p>Thornton is long. It runs primarily east of I-25 from 84th Avenue up to Highway 7, which is a considerable distance in local-search terms.</p>

      <p>That geography matters more than most business owners expect. Proximity is a ranking factor, so a business optimised only around the older southern end near 88th Avenue is frequently invisible to someone searching from a new development near 144th. Same city. Different result set.</p>

