        <a href="/locations/wheat-ridge-seo/" class="nr-c"><b>Wheat Ridge SEO →</b><span>South-west. Smaller, lighter competition, revitalising commercial districts.</span></a>
        <a href="/locations/" class="nr-c"><b>All service areas →</b><span>Thirteen Denver metro cities with dedicated strategies.</span></a>
      </div>

      <div class="callout c-tip">
        <p class="c-label">A note on Denver</p>
        <p>If you are weighing Thornton against Denver proper, read <a href="/blog/why-denver-is-a-hard-seo-market/">why Denver is one of the hardest SEO markets in Colorado</a> first. For a lot of north metro businesses, owning Thornton outright produces more revenue than placing seventh in Denver — and costs considerably less to achieve.</p>
      </div>

