      <p>Everything above is context. What matters is your position, in your category, in this city, right now.</p>

      <p>So the free audit is not a generic score from a tool. We look at where you sit in the Thornton map pack against the businesses currently taking your calls, what your <a href="/blog/google-business-profile-ranking-factors-denver/">Google Business Profile</a> is missing, whether your review flow has stalled, and whether AI assistants name you when asked about Thornton.</p>

