      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much does SEO cost in Thornton?<span class="faq-ico" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><p>Usually less than an equivalent Denver campaign, because there are fewer entrenched competitors to displace. The real driver is your industry rather than your city — a Thornton dentist competing against a handful of local practices needs less work than a Thornton roofer competing against national storm-chasing lead generators.</p><p>We publish general figures on our <a href="/denver-seo-pricing/">pricing page</a>, and we will tell you honestly during an audit if your market does not justify the spend.</p></div></div>

